extends layout

block content
  section.page-section(aria-labelledby="about-heading")
    .section-header
      h1#about-heading About Us
      p Family-owned since 1992, serving handcrafted donuts and fresh coffee in the heart of downtown.

    .about-grid
      article.story-block
        h2 Three Decades on Main Street
        p Since opening our doors in 1992, Downtown Donuts has focused on simple morning rituals done right: mixing dough before dawn, glazing classics like our Classic Glazed and Boston Cream by hand, and welcoming regulars by name at 123 Main Street.
        p Whether you stop in for a quick cup of locally roasted drip coffee on your commute or pick up a dozen donut holes for a weekend table, our goal has stayed the same—warm hospitality, consistent craft, and a cozy neighborhood spot you can count on.

      aside.info-card(aria-label="Location and Hours")
        h2 Shop Details
        p
          strong Established:
          |  1992
        p
          strong Location:
          |  123 Main Street, Downtown
        p
          strong Monday–Friday:
          |  6AM–6PM
        p
          strong Saturday–Sunday:
          |  7AM–4PM
        p
          strong Phone:
          |  (555) 867-5309
        p
          strong Catering:
          |  catering@downtowndonuts.com
        .action-group
          a.order-btn(href="/menu") Browse Menu
          a.secondary-link(href="/comments") Leave a Comment
[cite: 1, 2, 5, 7, 9]
